    "summary": "Added StatusBoard.publishLane(lane, status, sweep?) with its 'board.publishLane' hub op and a StatusBoardClient.publishLane method. The board keeps both lanes; the summary lane's publisher sets or clears the sweep; idle means both lanes are at depth 0 and not processing. Added queueStatusFromBoard (status.ts), which maps the board's lanes to daemon.status's queueDepth and queueLanes through composeQueueLanes, as today. RepoStatusSnapshot.completeness is now optional; RequestEnvelope has an optional underHold; DaemonStatus has an optional maintenance {state:'compacting', since (ISO), activity, reason}. Nothing sets these new fields yet. The existing board and status suites pass.",
